                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game shows some promise, and if you read the Early Access description it sounds like the devs have great plans for the future.\n\nWhat I'd like to see in future updates are more character creation and game types. Perhaps a challenger could set rules for a duel such as what weapons are allowed, the space between the shooters, or which location the duel takes place, and the challenged player could either accept, decline, or negotiate the rules. Other game types could involve more than just two shooters (imagine a 3 or 4 person duel!) or a contest to shoot target practice objects quickly. A full character creation would be great too. Getting money for winning a duel could be used to purchase cooler hats, bandannas, jackets, gun skins, you name it. Killing the other player in one shot is fun for now, but I'd like to try a gametype where players have health bars and take more damage in certain areas.\n\nFor now I'd say it's worth it's price, but note that it will go up as they add new elements to the game.",
